.Dd October 30, 2026
.Dt RPCBIND 8
.Os Minkar
.Sh NAME
.Nm rpcbind
.Nd the ONC RPC binder
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl d
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
maps ONC RPC programs and versions to the addresses their servers listen
on, on UDP and TCP port 111.
It speaks the portmapper protocol (version 2), which NFS clients use over
IPv4, and rpcbind's (versions 3 and 4, RFC 1833), with transports named
.Pq Li udp , tcp , udp6 ...
and universal addresses.
Services register and unregister from this machine only; indirect calls
are not made.
.Xr launchd 8
starts it (org.minkar.rpcbind) when a service, such as
.Xr nfsd 8 ,
first registers.
.Fl d
logs each registration.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mount_nfs 8 ,
.Xr nfsd 8
